  "title": "What the shift from cloud apps to agentic systems means for developers",
  "description": "AI is changing how applications and agents are built and operated. This lightning talk explains how agentic systems reason over context, take multi‑step actions, and adapt over time—and what that means for developers. We’ll cover how design, building, delivery, and operations evolve as apps become agent‑driven, and how Microsoft’s integrated agentic platform is able to support apps and agents responsibly in production.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
